<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap narrow prose">
    <p>This Privacy Policy explains how Scholars Planet ("we", "us", "our") collects, uses and protects information when you visit {{ site.url }} (the "Site").</p>

    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <p>You do not need an account to browse opportunities on this Site. We may collect limited information in these situations:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>If you contact us by email, WhatsApp, Facebook or Instagram, we receive whatever you choose to share in that conversation.</li>
      <li>Standard technical information collected automatically by our hosting provider (such as browser type, approximate location and pages visited), used in aggregate to understand how the Site is used.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Saved opportunities</h2>
    <p>When you save an opportunity, the choice is stored only in your own browser (local storage) on your device. We do not receive it, and it is not linked to you. Clearing your browser data removes it.</p>

    <h2>Cookies and advertising</h2>
    <p>This Site may display advertisements served by third parties, including Google AdSense. Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on a user's previous visits to this website or other websites. Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads based on your visit to this Site and other sites on the internet. You can opt out of personalised advertising in Google's <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ads Settings</a>.</p>

    <h2>How we use information</h2>
    <p>Any information we receive is used to respond to enquiries, improve the Site and share relevant scholarship and opportunity information. We do not sell personal information to third parties.</p>

    <h2>External links</h2>
    <p>This Site links to official scholarship, grant and programme pages operated by third parties. We are not responsible for their content or privacy practices. Review the privacy policy of any site before submitting personal information in an application.</p>

    <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
    <p>Some opportunities on this Site are for secondary school students. We do not knowingly collect personal information from young children.</p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated date.</p>

    <h2>Contact us</h2>
    <p>Questions about this policy can be sent to <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>
